LUNAR V1.4 modifications (2026-11-15): original mission information panel, hardware explanations, support placement and display transforms. Existing Apache-2.0 MoonTerrain renderer is reused and modified for optional local coordinates, camera exposure conversion and eclipse attenuation; original technical attribution above remains in force.

